WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.478 --> 00:00:03.710
(religious inspired music)

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.790
- [Narrator] The Tigray
Region in Northern Ethiopia

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.563
is known for its assembly
of rock-hewn churches.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.720
Sculpted out of sandstone,

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.070
the most wondrous of
these is Abuna Yemata Guh.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.300
There's only one way up.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.203
You have to climb this cliff face.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.263
Welcome to the world's
most perilous church.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:41.810
Established in the fifth century,

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:43.730
the church is named after its founder

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.423
and builder, Father Yemata.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.980
Perched 650 feet above a steep cliff,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.750
some say he chose its location

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.682
to be closer to heavenly spirits,

00:00:53.682 --> 00:00:57.263
others argue it was a strategic
move to avoid his enemies.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.810
Either way, the church's location,

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.890
ceiling frescoes and
precious goat skin bible

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.263
have attracted worshipers for centuries.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.630
The church has 20 clergymen.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:16.033
And is managed by this
high-ranking priest.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:19.970
He has lived here for over 47 years.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:22.063
And he makes the climb everyday.

00:01:23.739 --> 00:01:27.406
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.610
- [Narrator] For fearless worshipers,

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.260
the two hour trek to
the top begins by hiking

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:55.793
to the bottom of the rock
from the valley below.

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:02.125
Visitors must first remove
their shoes before climbing.

00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:05.792
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:28.750
- [Narrator] The final obstacle
to the church's entrance

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.193
can test the most ardent pilgrim's faith.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.330
A narrow cliff ledge with
a deadly drop to left

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.873
and no room for error.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.491
Once through you may
think you're in heaven,

00:02:44.491 --> 00:02:47.043
but you've never felt more alive.

00:02:49.186 --> 00:02:52.936
(speaking foreign language)

